{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/622925-sunburst-enterprises-ownership","id":622925,"title":"Sunburst Enterprises ownership","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-10T17:52:17-07:00","id":622925,"title":"Sunburst Enterprises ownership","content":"Hi, I've been reading my copy of W20: Book of the Wyrm. Good stuff. After digging through my copies of Book of the Wyrm 1st Ed, 2ed and Pentex: Subsidiaries I have a question. <br /> In Book of the Wyrm 1st edition Sunburst Enterprises is a subsidiary of Pentex.<br /> In Book of the Wyrm 2nd edition and in Pentex: Subsidiaries it's mentioned that Tellus Enterprises has taken over Sunburst and it's now just a division of Tellus.<br /> In W:20 Book of the Wyrm it's mentioned that Sunburst is a subsidiary of Pentex again.<br /> <br /> Is there a story behind this or did the author just miss this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6685-jasper","name":"Jasper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T19:35:26-07:00","id":623035,"title":"","content":"It could be that, or possibly more so the idea of &quot;time-line neutrality&quot; in-sync with &quot;meta-plot neutrality&quot;, wherein regardless of what *today's* year is, Sunburst may, for purposes of W:20, be its own company still. (Not all of the timeline aspects of the various lines are &quot;advanced&quot; -- some are, some are middle ground, and some hark back to the early days of the various gamelines. &gt;shrugs&lt; )","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for